    <!-- FAQActivity -->
    <string name="title_faq">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How do I book a lab?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">You can book a lab by selecting the desired lab card on the home dashboard, then choosing an available day and time slot.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Can I cancel a booking?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Yes, you can cancel your bookings through the \'My Booking\' section in the side menu by clicking \'Clear All Bookings\'.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What are the lab operating hours?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Labs are typically open from 8:00 AM to 6:00 PM on weekdays. Please refer to the specific lab\'s schedule for weekend availability.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Are there any specific lab rules?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Yes. No food or drinks are allowed inside. Users must leave the lab clean and ensure all equipment is turned off after use.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">What should I do if the equipment is faulty?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Please report any faulty equipment immediately to the lab technician or through the \'Help &amp; Support\' section.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How many bookings can I make per day?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Students are allowed a maximum of 2 active bookings per day to ensure fair access for everyone.</string>
    <string name="faq_q7">What if I need the lab for the whole day for an activity?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">Whole-day bookings for special activities or events require administrative approval. Please visit the Lab Management Office to submit a formal request at least 3 days in advance.</string>

